  "cross_tradition_view": "Most of these traditions would likely value respecting property, acting prudently, and maintaining good faith with a neighbour; many would accept trimming overhang from one's own side while still criticizing the failure to communicate. They could split over whether prior consent was owed, especially because the tree was healthy and the actual harm to the vegetable bed is uncertain.",
